/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]newest entry equals the live clipboard, refuses loudly and writes [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]nothing otherwise, and reports which provider supplied each entry [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and how old it is — in bob's JSON, its human output, a `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]clipboard` status report, and the Mac Clip card.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]percent_c_history_agreement.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/percent_c_history_agreement.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-he[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-he/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]History providers, Alfred adapter, Clipy fixes, and config [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]selection[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]providers[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]providers: add the HistoryEntry provider boundary, a read-only Alfred [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]adapter, the Clipy tie-break/flavor/concealed fixes, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture.clipboard_history selection.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Trust history only when its newest entry equals the live [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]clipboard[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]agreement[dim] · [dim][/dim]after providers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agreement: replace the lag-tolerant merge with the bounded-wait [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agreement check, per-provider diagnoses, typed refusal codes, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-history regression test.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Report history provider and entry ages[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]provenance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agreement[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]provenance: add clip.history {provider, entries[{age_seconds, app}]} to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture JSON and one provenance line to human output.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac Clip card shows provider and ages[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after provenance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-card: in bob-mac-capture, decode clip.history tolerantly, show [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provider and ages in the Clip card, and drop the Clipy wording from the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pin Alfred in the managed bob config[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]alfred-pin[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agreement[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]alfred-pin: in chezmoi, set capture.clipboard_history to alfred and stop[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paste_parts from killing and relaunching Clipy, per the paste_parts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One clipboard snapshot per capture and bounded clipboard [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]commands[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]read-hardening[dim] · [dim][/dim]after provenance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]read-hardening: share one live read and one largest-count history read [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per capture invocation, and run every clipboard command with a deadline,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output cap, and reaping.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read-only bob clipboard status report[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]status-command[dim] · [dim][/dim]after read-hardening[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]status-command: add top-level `bob clipboard` (Integrations) reporting [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selection, per-provider health, and whether %c<N> would succeed, never [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]printing contents.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Acceptance on the Mac and wait tuning[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-acceptance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after status-command[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-acceptance: build a scratch bob on the Mac, replay the original [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-Clipy failure, run the gated clipboard rows, and tune the wait to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Alfred's measured lag.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-he","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-he.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-c2e4d2880c2c34203d323c393bf8df70","started_at":"2026-11-05T15:35:49.925385+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"12d34867cdf8b8da2b94370e55b64d375ff0d4709c986496704bab1a7a63d1b5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-he.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"4e7def22c2d53527d233852026187be0dd5a1f644d40d3c9356f60952c55d86d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-he.3/meta.json","size_bytes":687},"prompt":{"digest":"ea833787a677092292de3552fb5d5c722000eedf6e88812a16501094ada75b24","path":"agents/b